  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">219443_Somalia Crisis Recovery Project - Early Recovery (SCRP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This component will provide support to both floods and drought affected communities by: a) restoring livelihoods through restoring agricultural crop and livestock production where relevant; restoring and supporting other livelihoods interventions, and; b) providing basic services including water, sanitation, education and basic health services.</narrative>
  </description>
